        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kilïm pöytoghintö ngala kirurut kesomönöy, kïpalpal sïrokachi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atolapay kïmwochï Ilkia nko Aikam wero Syapan nko Apdon wero Mika nko Syapan kikirin nko Asaya mötworinto pöytoghin lö, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ape atepunö ECHOTYON kïmwowanïn nko pich cho kidong koro Israel nko Yuda paraku ngala kitapunï kökïnyorï, kinörekyecha ECHOTYON nyoman ompöwölo marïpnye papotïnecho ngölyonto ECHOTYON, ameghcha kïrïp kegh wölnö kikikirta ompö kitapunï.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïwö Ilkia nko pich cho kiyoktö pöytoghintö wölo mi korka nyo le werkoyon nyo kïkuro Ulda koko Syalum wero Tokat wero Asra, ripinto wölo kitöni sïro cho kïpöghisyegho ompö Kö pö Tororöt (kimöngöy kokononi Yerusalem okuntö nyo pö odeny) kïmwochï kokononi ngal cho kighisyö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï kokonay pïchay, mwoghöy ECHOTYON Tororöt pö Israel lö, “Omwochinö chichona keyokwokwa wölo omitan lö, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwoghöy ECHOTYON lö, ‘Oyonchinan kïgh nyo gha Yerusalem nko pich cho möngöy wöloni, pkonöy chïputchay löwïr kikikirchi kitapunay kikisomönö tawu pöytoghinto Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompöwölo kipïstanïn akïpelchï amöros tororötin walak, atökwighanïn onörekyan ighisyewut löwïr cho igho chane morikwa omïlchinan nörekyenyan yi, amöminye chi nyo muköy tökïnuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo omwochinekwa pöytoghinto Yuda nyo keyokwokwa lö, mwoghöy ECHOTYON Tororöt pö Israel lö, kïrïp kegh nko ngalechay kelïmanyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akïnyorï mïkulöwungu lastagh, aipönyi kegh ngwïny ompö tawunyan aipalpal sïroköku ailoka tawunyan kyalïminyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otinö kachengan söpengu le ato kyachengan cho pö papotïneku kerorchinyi pïrïmpengu ompö kalya amösïwïyinye konyiku ghöyityö löwïr nyo opchinan Yerusalem nko pich cho möngöy ori.’ ” Kïlenyona kwipï pïchay lökoyechay kwïpchï pöytoghin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kam Yosia muma* kïkonyït Tororöt",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïkurtö pöytoghintö kïkur poyi Yuda nko cho pö Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpusta pöytoghintö kutang Kö pö Tororöt nko mïrön pö Yuda löwïr nko möngi Yerusalem nko tïsï nko pipö Lawi nko pich löwïr cho echön nko cho mïnkech, akusomönö ngala kitapunay pö muma kikïnyorchï Kö pö Tororöt kïlïmöy chane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kughyongö pöytoghintö wölo ghyongo pöytoghï akwama muma tawu ECHOTYON kïrïp ECHOTYON kïrip kirurutkachi nko mwowutkachi nko kikirutkachi ompö mïkulöwunyi löwïr nko ompö söpenyi löwïr, kwigh ngala muma cho kikikirchï kitapunï. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kwigh pipö Yerusalem nko cho pö Penchamen cho kimi atoni kuyomis lö, kïripöy mumanoni. Kwigh nyu möngi Yerusalem le wölo mwoytoy muma Tororöto papotïnekwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunategha nyu Yosia tïkwïn löwïr ompö wölo kimöngöy pipö Israel, akwigh pich löwïr cho kimi Israel kïpöghisyechï ECHOTYON Tororötïngwa. Möpïstönye pich kïrïp ECHOTYON Tororöt pö papotïnekwa ompö osiswo pöytoghin Yoasiya löwïr.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
